# {{NAME_TITLE}} — Decisions

Closed decisions. Append-only with importance-scoring, cross-linked when
related decisions are superseded.

**Format per entry:**

```markdown
## <slug-of-decision>
\`\`\`yaml
importance: 1-10
captured: YYYY-MM-DD
tags: [tag1, tag2]
status: open | closed | superseded
superseded_by: <other-slug>    # if status is superseded
\`\`\`

**Question:** <what we were deciding>

**Choice:** <what was chosen>

**Rationale:** <why — 2–3 sentences, the durable reasoning>

**Trigger to revisit:** <what would make us reconsider>
```

**Cross-link on write (A-MEM):** When you close a decision that contradicts
an earlier one, find the earlier entry and set `status: superseded` +
`superseded_by: <this-slug>`. Don't delete — the audit trail is the point.

